'''Ragin' Gory''' (怒りのブラッゴリ, ''Ikari no Buraggori'', '''Raging Black Gory''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Gory Dark]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]], and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 10.5 Update|Version 10.5]].

